  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.14 Lake Coniston. The lower portion of Lake Coniston in the town of Croydon shall be a \"no wake\" area.\n\nSource. #2351, eff 4-25-83; ss by #3010, eff 5-2-85; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES: 5-3-95 (formerly Saf-C 402.15); ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95; ss by #7798, eff 12-3-02; ss and moved by #8172, eff 9-21-04 (formerly Saf-C 402.131); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.14) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
